Q: Kibana: Search within text for string A: <p>I am using Kibana 8.1 from the user interface. Just add a filter like log_message &quot;is&quot; hibernate3. The &quot;is&quot; operator in Kibana seems to mean contains.</p>
<p>Elasticsearch Query DSL:</p>
<pre><code>{
  &quot;query&quot;: {
    &quot;match_phrase&quot;: {
      &quot;log_message&quot;: &quot;hibernate3&quot;
    }
  }
}
</code></pre>
